WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.096 --> 01:54.952
=Episode 27=

22
01:56.200 --> 01:56.719
Honey,

23
01:58.400 --> 01:58.840
the company

24
01:58.879 --> 02:00.064
just landed a big project,

25
02:00.799 --> 02:02.319
so cash flow is a bit tight.

26
02:03.040 --> 02:04.200
I'll have to funnel

27
02:04.280 --> 02:05.239
all my income

28
02:05.239 --> 02:06.049
into the company.

29
02:08.319 --> 02:09.199
What project is it?

30
02:10.400 --> 02:11.080
Well...

31
02:19.368 --> 02:21.128
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

32
02:26.879 --> 02:27.400
Honey,

33
02:28.560 --> 02:29.639
why did you suddenly

34
02:30.120 --> 02:31.800
set up the memorial tablets at home?

35
02:32.360 --> 02:33.416
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

36
02:34.439 --> 02:35.560
I've always wanted that.

37
02:36.280 --> 02:36.800
It's just

38
02:36.800 --> 02:38.000
that we kept moving

39
02:38.280 --> 02:39.280
and never settled down.

40
02:39.879 --> 02:40.800
Now that we've finally

41
02:41.199 --> 02:42.039
settled down

42
02:43.479 --> 02:45.039
in such a wonderful place,

43
02:45.360 --> 02:46.039
I can finally

44
02:46.560 --> 02:47.800
set up their tablets

45
02:48.520 --> 02:49.719
to pay them respect,

46
02:50.360 --> 02:51.479
show our filial devotion,

47
02:51.719 --> 02:52.639
and reassure them.

48
02:53.479 --> 02:54.280
Am I right?

49
02:56.080 --> 02:56.520
Yeah.

50
02:58.400 --> 02:59.759
Let's light some incense for them.

51
04:00.199 --> 04:01.400
Mom, Dad,

52
04:02.919 --> 04:03.719
Liren and I

53
04:04.000 --> 04:04.840
can finally

54
04:04.919 --> 04:06.400
bow before you.

55
04:07.039 --> 04:07.879
Mom, you never

56
04:08.439 --> 04:09.240
got to meet Liren.

57
04:11.199 --> 04:12.120
He's your son-in-law.

58
04:12.840 --> 04:13.639
He lived up

59
04:13.759 --> 04:14.599
to Dad's expectations

60
04:15.120 --> 04:16.319
and achieved success.

61
04:17.279 --> 04:18.360
He made a lot of money,

62
04:19.040 --> 04:20.360
made me a wealthy lady,

63
04:21.000 --> 04:22.040
and gave me a big house.

64
04:23.920 --> 04:24.920
If you could see this,

65
04:25.160 --> 04:26.160
you'd be happy, right?

66
04:27.480 --> 04:28.399
I miss you both.

67
04:30.480 --> 04:31.784
Please visit me in my dreams.

68
04:31.784 --> 04:32.600
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

69
04:32.600 --> 04:33.879
Dad, don't be partial.

70
04:34.839 --> 04:35.480
I bet

71
04:36.360 --> 04:37.920
you're always thinking about Liren

72
04:38.839 --> 04:40.120
and visiting him in his dreams.

73
04:41.608 --> 04:42.519
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

74
04:42.519 --> 04:43.519
What kind of secrets

75
04:43.600 --> 04:44.480
do you whisper to him?

76
04:45.160 --> 04:46.199
Do you bless him,

77
04:47.439 --> 04:48.079
or...

78
04:49.160 --> 04:49.680
Honey.

79
04:51.000 --> 04:52.480
Let Mom and Dad rest.

80
04:53.759 --> 04:54.480
Get some rest too.

81
04:55.279 --> 04:56.360
If you keep talking,

82
04:56.720 --> 04:58.000
you may get overwhelmed

83
04:58.399 --> 04:59.439
and become too upset

84
04:59.959 --> 05:00.839
to eat anything.

85
05:01.759 --> 05:02.720
Let's eat first, okay?

86
05:03.639 --> 05:04.120
Okay.

87
05:08.399 --> 05:09.360
Hot pot tonight?

88
05:09.879 --> 05:11.199
It's been a while.

89
05:11.800 --> 05:12.639
Hot pot at home

90
05:12.759 --> 05:14.040
is always fresh and clean.

91
05:14.759 --> 05:15.920
You're always so thoughtful.

92
05:17.399 --> 05:18.160
Haoyu's condition

93
05:18.439 --> 05:19.399
has improved too.

94
05:20.000 --> 05:20.959
We can finally

95
05:21.279 --> 05:22.160
have dinner together.

96
05:22.800 --> 05:23.839
I'll cook in person.

97
05:30.279 --> 05:31.040
Is this a work file

98
05:31.160 --> 05:31.920
sent to me?

99
05:32.759 --> 05:33.526
It was sent to me.

100
05:34.519 --> 05:36.000
But it doesn't clearly say

101
05:36.480 --> 05:37.399
(Sender: Mr. Peng) who sent it.

102
05:37.680 --> 05:38.920
It just says Mr. Peng.

103
05:45.192 --> 05:46.472
(Lu Zhiming's car accident case closed)

104
05:51.688 --> 05:52.560
(Garment factory owner died in a car accident)

105
05:52.560 --> 05:53.600
Why is anybody

106
05:53.839 --> 05:54.360
sending me

107
05:54.360 --> 05:55.160
this kind of stuff?

108
05:57.040 --> 05:57.519
Look.

109
06:05.680 --> 06:06.764
Must be our competitors.

110
06:09.519 --> 06:10.720
They know you're my wife.

111
06:11.519 --> 06:12.720
They looked you up

112
06:13.319 --> 06:14.000
and pulled

113
06:14.000 --> 06:14.839
such a dirty trick

114
06:15.399 --> 06:16.319
to mess with you.

115
06:16.959 --> 06:17.800
Such disgusting games

116
06:17.800 --> 06:19.720
happen in the business world

117
06:19.759 --> 06:20.399
all the time.

118
06:20.861 --> 06:21.759
I dragged you into it.

119
06:22.240 --> 06:23.839
How can such scummy, low-class rivals

120
06:23.920 --> 06:24.639
even

121
06:24.639 --> 06:25.959
compete with you?

122
06:26.360 --> 06:27.560
Step up your game

123
06:27.839 --> 06:28.879
and steer clear of them.

124
06:33.000 --> 06:34.439
This is so strange.

125
06:35.519 --> 06:37.199
When you were with Yu Meng,

126
06:37.920 --> 06:38.800
she never

127
06:38.800 --> 06:39.959
received anything like this.

128
06:41.480 --> 06:42.319
Is someone trying

129
06:43.319 --> 06:44.439
to hint at something?

130
06:48.720 --> 06:50.240
Maybe it's because she's an influencer

131
06:50.720 --> 06:52.120
with plenty of connections.

132
06:52.639 --> 06:53.600
They didn't dare.

133
06:58.120 --> 06:58.680
It's boiling.

134
06:59.879 --> 07:00.519
Let's eat first.

135
07:03.240 --> 07:04.319
When Dad was alive,

136
07:04.480 --> 07:05.439
this was his favorite.

137
07:06.680 --> 07:07.920
He kept traveling to Nanjing

138
07:08.639 --> 07:10.240
for the duck blood curd.

139
07:38.376 --> 07:39.112
(Beloved Father, Lu Zhiming Beloved Mother, Wang Xiuzhi)

140
08:05.279 --> 08:05.800
What's wrong?

141
08:07.040 --> 08:08.079
Are you okay?

142
08:09.839 --> 08:10.360
I'm fine.

143
08:10.720 --> 08:12.240
Maybe I'm just overwhelmed

144
08:12.720 --> 08:13.439
with work

145
08:14.800 --> 08:15.720
and stressed out.

146
08:16.639 --> 08:17.439
Forget it.

147
08:17.920 --> 08:19.120
I'll head back to the office.

148
08:23.639 --> 08:24.519
You should've seen

149
08:25.240 --> 08:26.480
how fast Di Liren ran off.

150
08:27.079 --> 08:28.920
Looks like sending the file

151
08:29.160 --> 08:30.040
under Mr. Peng's name

152
08:30.720 --> 08:31.959
put a lot of pressure on him.

153
08:32.440 --> 08:33.320
He's scraping money

154
08:33.480 --> 08:34.519
for Peng Cheng.

155
08:35.159 --> 08:36.519
The moment he walked in,

156
08:36.519 --> 08:37.559
he mentioned

157
08:38.039 --> 08:38.840
this "big project".

158
08:40.120 --> 08:41.080
I bet he'll start

159
08:41.200 --> 08:42.120
asking me for money.

160
08:42.759 --> 08:43.720
He's truly panicked.

161
08:44.799 --> 08:45.720
He's still out

162
08:46.080 --> 08:46.879
at this hour?

163
08:48.120 --> 08:49.320
"Working overtime."

164
08:50.399 --> 08:50.879
I bet

165
08:51.360 --> 08:52.639
he won't be back these days.

166
09:13.120 --> 09:13.639
Mr. Di.

167
09:18.360 --> 09:19.399
Mr. Di, your coffee.

168
09:24.720 --> 09:26.039
Didn't you see those clothes?

169
09:29.360 --> 09:30.399
Take them to wash.

170
09:38.240 --> 09:38.679
Hold on.

171
09:41.480 --> 09:42.200
This too.

172
09:53.440 --> 09:53.960
What?

173
09:55.440 --> 09:56.360
Mad already?

174
09:57.799 --> 09:58.519
When you were

175
09:58.600 --> 09:59.919
talking nonsense with Peng Cheng,

176
09:59.919 --> 10:00.559
didn't you know

177
10:00.639 --> 10:01.639
how I'd deal with you?

178
10:03.480 --> 10:03.960
I guess

179
10:04.000 --> 10:05.279
I was too good to you before.

180
10:06.000 --> 10:06.919
Good to me?

181
10:07.840 --> 10:09.039
Such talk is just ridiculous

182
10:09.039 --> 10:10.120
in the business world.

183
10:10.919 --> 10:12.039
You knew what I was after

184
10:12.360 --> 10:13.879
by sticking with you.

185
10:14.879 --> 10:16.240
I gave you so much.

186
10:16.879 --> 10:18.000
Wasn't it enough?

187
10:18.799 --> 10:20.639
Drop the condescending tone.

188
10:20.679 --> 10:22.600
We just took what we each needed.

189
10:22.879 --> 10:23.879
I did your dirty work,

190
10:24.080 --> 10:25.039
and you paid my wages.

191
10:25.600 --> 10:26.679
I worked for you

192
10:26.799 --> 10:28.480
because this "ship" was big enough.

193
10:28.879 --> 10:29.519
But now,

194
10:29.559 --> 10:30.360
it's about to sink.

195
10:30.480 --> 10:31.639
Why should I stay?

196
10:32.240 --> 10:32.960
To save you?

197
10:34.360 --> 10:36.320
An ungrateful traitor like you

198
10:37.039 --> 10:38.360
doesn't deserve to be my ally.

199
10:39.200 --> 10:40.720
I'd kick you out, anyway.

200
10:40.799 --> 10:42.360
You're the stray dog here,

201
10:43.080 --> 10:44.240
hiding in your office,

202
10:44.360 --> 10:45.480
too scared to go home.

203
10:45.559 --> 10:46.960
How dare you boss me around!

204
10:47.279 --> 10:47.888
You know what?

205
10:49.039 --> 10:50.840
We both crawled out

206
10:51.440 --> 10:52.559
of some small town.

207
10:52.679 --> 10:54.600
You're not any better than me.

208
10:56.759 --> 10:57.720
Without the Yu family,

209
10:58.559 --> 10:59.360
you're nothing.

210
11:00.440 --> 11:01.360
Without me,

211
11:02.080 --> 11:03.080
you're nothing too!

212
11:06.320 --> 11:06.840
When you came

213
11:06.879 --> 11:08.240
from that godforsaken place

214
11:08.320 --> 11:09.240
to Jiangzhou,

215
11:09.840 --> 11:10.759
you had no money

216
11:11.279 --> 11:12.440
and nowhere to live.

217
11:12.960 --> 11:13.519
I covered

218
11:13.639 --> 11:14.960
your room and board at first

219
11:15.152 --> 11:16.120
to give you a foothold.

220
11:18.679 --> 11:20.440
I pulled you out of the gutter.

221
11:20.960 --> 11:21.440
What?

222
11:22.000 --> 11:23.279
Now you're backstabbing me?

223
11:23.480 --> 11:24.960
Cut the hypocrisy.

224
11:25.440 --> 11:26.320
You only helped me

225
11:26.320 --> 11:27.240
to use me.

226
11:27.440 --> 11:28.039
You knew

227
11:28.080 --> 11:29.080
I was desperate

228
11:29.240 --> 11:29.919
to make money.

229
11:30.039 --> 11:31.720
So you trusted me with your dirty work.

230
11:35.080 --> 11:36.159
You kept bossing me around.

231
11:36.240 --> 11:37.440
I've been dying to quit.

232
11:38.000 --> 11:38.519
Fine.

233
11:41.200 --> 11:42.360
Even if you quit,

234
11:43.320 --> 11:44.799
I have plenty of ways to ruin you.

235
11:44.840 --> 11:45.440
Bring it on.

236
11:46.000 --> 11:46.679
Destroy me.

237
11:47.519 --> 11:48.799
I'll drag you down with me

238
11:48.799 --> 11:49.679
if I go down.

239
11:50.240 --> 11:51.600
I did so much dirty work for you.

240
11:51.639 --> 11:53.120
You think I don't have dirt on you?

241
11:54.480 --> 11:55.480
Keep a backup plan.

242
11:56.200 --> 11:57.279
You taught me that.

243
12:00.440 --> 12:01.279
Besides,

244
12:02.360 --> 12:03.080
you shouldn't be

245
12:03.120 --> 12:04.559
wasting your energy on me.

246
12:06.639 --> 12:07.279
Check it out.

247
12:13.992 --> 12:14.600
(From nightclub thug to trophy son-in-law)

248
12:14.600 --> 12:15.400
(Fraudulent marriage of cosmetics Chairman DLR)

249
12:25.512 --> 12:26.120
(Boycott the trash, boycott Jiali)

250
12:26.248 --> 12:26.824
(Stay far away from trash gold-diggers)

251
12:26.824 --> 12:27.560
(Someone decoded it)

252
12:27.560 --> 12:28.328
(Could it be Jiali?)

253
12:33.320 --> 12:34.344
(That online trophy wife?)

254
12:34.440 --> 12:34.799
Well...

255
12:35.360 --> 12:36.639
(Truth uncovered) Don't tell me it's real.

256
12:36.759 --> 12:38.000
(Total fraud wanting to marry rich) What should we do?

257
12:38.000 --> 12:39.784
(Could it be Jiali?)

258
12:44.000 --> 12:45.279
Who posted this?

259
12:45.384 --> 12:46.728
(That online trophy wife?)

260
12:52.008 --> 12:53.320
(From nightclub thug to trophy son-in-law)

261
12:53.448 --> 12:54.216
(Fraudulent marriage of cosmetics Chairman DLR)

262
12:54.720 --> 12:55.960
(Fraud) This looks like Mr. Di from Jiali.

263
12:56.080 --> 12:56.799
(Gold-digger) So explosive.

264
13:06.000 --> 13:06.480
Peng Cheng,

265
13:08.440 --> 13:10.080
if you know what's good for you,

266
13:10.519 --> 13:11.600
take down

267
13:11.600 --> 13:13.000
all those posts right now.

268
13:13.440 --> 13:14.039
What posts?

269
13:14.639 --> 13:15.320
I have no idea.

270
13:16.000 --> 13:17.039
Drop the act.

271
13:18.120 --> 13:19.720
Only you know about this.

272
13:21.919 --> 13:22.679
I was just worried

273
13:22.759 --> 13:23.759
you're an important man

274
13:23.879 --> 13:24.679
with a short memory.

275
13:25.159 --> 13:26.600
So I posted it as a reminder.

276
13:27.279 --> 13:28.559
Is this how you remind people?

277
13:28.840 --> 13:30.000
I just envy you.

278
13:30.799 --> 13:32.360
You had no money for school.

279
13:32.759 --> 13:34.080
Lu Zhiming sponsored you.

280
13:34.120 --> 13:34.519
Right?

281
13:34.759 --> 13:36.000
I treated you like a brother.

282
13:36.120 --> 13:36.799
I told you

283
13:36.919 --> 13:38.120
to seek opportunities

284
13:38.120 --> 13:38.840
with Lu Zhiming.

285
13:39.360 --> 13:40.320
That was how

286
13:40.360 --> 13:41.600
you got a job at his factory

287
13:42.240 --> 13:43.360
and seduced his daughter

288
13:43.480 --> 13:44.320
in the end.

289
13:44.960 --> 13:46.200
Not to mention Yu Meng.

290
13:46.919 --> 13:47.720
If I hadn't

291
13:48.320 --> 13:50.120
staged that car accident for you,

292
13:50.759 --> 13:52.519
could you have married into wealth?

293
13:53.000 --> 13:53.559
But honestly,

294
13:54.000 --> 13:54.919
I do admire you.

295
13:55.399 --> 13:56.039
You had the guts

296
13:56.159 --> 13:57.240
to stab yourself.

297
13:57.879 --> 13:58.519
But why should I

298
13:58.600 --> 13:59.559
go to prison for you

299
13:59.759 --> 14:01.159
while you get to be a big boss?

300
14:04.960 --> 14:05.799
So I think

301
14:06.679 --> 14:08.120
I deserved all the money

302
14:09.000 --> 14:09.919
I asked for.

303
14:13.159 --> 14:14.320
Without me,

304
14:15.240 --> 14:16.480
you lowlife wouldn't have

305
14:16.600 --> 14:17.519
lived in such luxury.

306
14:18.440 --> 14:19.919
You'd have rotten in a ditch

307
14:20.120 --> 14:21.000
all by yourself.

308
14:21.679 --> 14:22.159
Tell me.

309
14:23.120 --> 14:24.519
Do you still want the money?

310
14:31.360 --> 14:32.519
All right, don't be mad.

311
14:34.120 --> 14:35.799
I just want the money.

312
14:36.200 --> 14:37.399
So I did this to urge you.

313
14:37.879 --> 14:39.279
Both of us have dirty secrets.

314
14:40.240 --> 14:41.240
The only difference is

315
14:41.799 --> 14:43.200
whether they get exposed.

316
14:44.240 --> 14:45.799
If you push me too far,

317
14:46.360 --> 14:47.600
I won't let you off.

318
14:49.000 --> 14:50.600
I have nothing to lose.

319
14:51.799 --> 14:53.399
But you have a company and status.

320
14:54.080 --> 14:54.480
If

321
14:54.480 --> 14:55.279
this gets out,

322
14:55.399 --> 14:56.720
it'll hit you harder, right?

323
14:57.360 --> 14:58.240
All right.

324
14:58.279 --> 14:58.919
Calm down.

325
14:59.320 --> 14:59.960
Take it easy.

326
15:01.080 --> 15:01.559
You know

327
15:01.679 --> 15:02.600
I'm impatient.

328
15:03.200 --> 15:04.440
You've been stalling

329
15:04.440 --> 15:05.279
for far too long.

330
15:05.879 --> 15:06.559
Just pay me.

331
15:06.639 --> 15:07.559
Problem solved.

332
15:08.000 --> 15:08.545
This week.

333
15:10.080 --> 15:11.279
I'll pay you this week.

334
15:12.320 --> 15:13.320
But first, delete

335
15:13.360 --> 15:13.960
those posts.

336
15:15.159 --> 15:16.519
Cash on delivery.

337
15:16.600 --> 15:17.960
Then I'll clear your name.

338
15:18.159 --> 15:19.200
No bargaining.

339
15:21.000 --> 15:22.240
Go scrape up the cash, sir.

340
15:32.679 --> 15:33.919
We've tried every PR move

341
15:33.960 --> 15:34.600
to handle it,

342
15:34.799 --> 15:35.960
but partners keep calling in

343
15:36.000 --> 15:36.639
to halt

344
