for you.

698
32:28.000 --> 32:29.079
Haomeng 2.0

699
32:29.240 --> 32:30.880
is launching soon.

700
32:33.000 --> 32:33.720
You know what?

701
32:34.200 --> 32:35.759
Kang Long is actually really talented.

702
32:35.839 --> 32:36.519
(He came up)

703
32:37.000 --> 32:38.047
(with some great ideas.)

704
32:40.799 --> 32:41.799
(If you were awake,)

705
32:42.119 --> 32:44.200
(you'd love talking business and science)

706
32:44.279 --> 32:45.160
(with him.)

707
32:46.519 --> 32:46.971
All right,

708
32:47.480 --> 32:48.519
I've rambled on so much.

709
32:48.559 --> 32:49.599
You must be tired of me.

710
32:50.599 --> 32:51.279
I have to go.

711
32:52.200 --> 32:53.200
I'll see you tomorrow.

712
33:00.240 --> 33:00.640
Dad?

713
33:01.839 --> 33:02.279
Dad.

714
33:04.599 --> 33:05.119
Doctor.

715
33:05.440 --> 33:05.920
Doctor.

716
33:05.920 --> 33:07.720
(Jiangzhou Hospital)

717
33:07.720 --> 33:08.200
Doctor,

718
33:08.519 --> 33:09.778
does he need further treatment?

719
33:09.920 --> 33:11.279
I suggest...

720
33:15.400 --> 33:17.119
You know how long you've been asleep?

721
33:17.720 --> 33:19.000
I was worried sick.

722
33:20.759 --> 33:21.880
I thought

723
33:21.880 --> 33:23.480
you'd never wake up.

724
33:23.880 --> 33:25.079
How could you be so cruel

725
33:25.160 --> 33:26.359
and leave me all alone?

726
33:26.960 --> 33:28.119
What would I do

727
33:28.240 --> 33:29.480
for the rest of my life?

728
33:32.319 --> 33:33.880
Ma'am, please keep some distance.

729
33:34.279 --> 33:34.960
Who are you?

730
33:37.200 --> 33:38.720
Why are you hugging me?

731
33:38.920 --> 33:39.880
Why are you crying?

732
33:40.160 --> 33:40.720
Why?

733
33:41.000 --> 33:42.119
I'm your wife.

734
33:42.279 --> 33:43.480
Who else could I be?

735
33:43.799 --> 33:45.160
You're my wife?

736
33:45.519 --> 33:46.599
No way.

737
33:46.759 --> 33:47.720
Look at you.

738
33:47.920 --> 33:49.079
You look like my mom.

739
33:49.240 --> 33:50.279
I'm not even married.

740
33:50.279 --> 33:51.720
How could I be married to you?

741
33:52.119 --> 33:52.920
Yu Jianguo,

742
33:53.519 --> 33:55.240
you're a year older than me.

743
33:55.720 --> 33:57.000
I'm older than you?

744
33:58.119 --> 33:59.079
Just look at yourself.

745
33:59.720 --> 34:01.079
You look sixty.

746
34:01.319 --> 34:03.359
I'm only 25.

747
34:04.759 --> 34:05.559
You...

748
34:06.599 --> 34:07.319
Just look.

749
34:07.599 --> 34:08.519
Look at yourself.

750
34:08.800 --> 34:09.159
Here.

751
34:09.480 --> 34:10.320
Take a look.

752
34:10.440 --> 34:11.000
What is this?

753
34:12.119 --> 34:12.599
A mirror.

754
34:13.039 --> 34:14.159
Such a tiny mirror...

755
34:26.800 --> 34:27.480
I get it now.

756
34:29.360 --> 34:30.679
My illness

757
34:31.519 --> 34:33.559
made me look old.

758
34:36.199 --> 34:38.079
But I'm only 25.

759
34:42.920 --> 34:43.679
What's going on?

760
34:44.400 --> 34:45.440
The test results

761
34:45.719 --> 34:46.400
suggest

762
34:46.840 --> 34:47.880
the patient is suffering

763
34:47.920 --> 34:49.679
from retrograde amnesia.

764
34:49.840 --> 34:50.599
It was likely

765
34:50.719 --> 34:52.119
triggered by brain damage

766
34:52.239 --> 34:53.440
in specific areas

767
34:53.519 --> 34:54.880
caused by his previous stroke.

768
34:55.639 --> 34:56.880
Simply put,

769
34:57.360 --> 34:58.840
memories closest to the stroke

770
34:59.239 --> 35:00.719
are the most likely to be lost.

771
35:01.440 --> 35:01.960
Meanwhile,

772
35:02.280 --> 35:03.599
memories from decades ago

773
35:04.079 --> 35:05.679
remain remarkably clear.

774
35:06.039 --> 35:07.320
You mean

775
35:08.320 --> 35:09.559
he genuinely thinks

776
35:09.719 --> 35:10.840
he's in his twenties?

777
35:11.320 --> 35:11.760
Yes.

778
35:12.360 --> 35:13.199
Is there

779
35:13.360 --> 35:14.679
any other treatment?

780
35:15.159 --> 35:15.760
There is none

781
35:15.920 --> 35:17.320
at the moment.

782
35:18.320 --> 35:19.320
Mom, calm down.

783
35:20.840 --> 35:21.800
Dad didn't forget you

784
35:21.920 --> 35:22.920
on purpose.

785
35:23.599 --> 35:24.400
Didn't the doctor

786
35:24.400 --> 35:25.280
tell us what to do?

787
35:26.039 --> 35:27.039
If we talk to him more

788
35:27.159 --> 35:28.199
about the past

789
35:28.599 --> 35:29.360
and jog his memory,

790
35:30.159 --> 35:30.960
gradually,

791
35:31.119 --> 35:31.920
he'll remember.

792
35:34.000 --> 35:34.440
All right.

793
35:35.360 --> 35:36.280
I'll try.

794
35:47.400 --> 35:47.960
Ms. Hui.

795
35:50.039 --> 35:51.079
I heard Mr. Yu woke up.

796
35:51.559 --> 35:52.519
I came to visit him.

797
35:52.719 --> 35:53.440
But he...

798
35:55.000 --> 35:55.679
It's fine.

799
35:56.280 --> 35:57.239
My dad has weathered

800
35:57.760 --> 35:58.519
every storm

801
35:58.679 --> 35:59.599
life threw at him.

802
35:59.880 --> 36:00.800
He'll pull through

803
36:01.119 --> 36:02.119
this time too.

804
36:02.840 --> 36:03.480
Come in and sit.

805
36:04.159 --> 36:04.639
It's fine.

806
36:05.599 --> 36:06.679
I also came to return

807
36:08.239 --> 36:08.800
the money.

808
36:12.840 --> 36:14.159
I once told Mr. Yu

809
36:14.320 --> 36:15.480
that I wanted to open a shop.

810
36:16.000 --> 36:16.719
He immediately

811
36:16.800 --> 36:17.760
made a plan

812
36:18.391 --> 36:19.674
about a physical therapy clinic

813
36:19.719 --> 36:20.840
near the villas,

814
36:21.639 --> 36:22.679
and offered to invest.

815
36:23.119 --> 36:24.599
I thought he was joking,

816
36:25.440 --> 36:26.159
but he actually

817
36:26.320 --> 36:27.016
wired the money.

818
36:27.199 --> 36:27.760
I was going to

819
36:27.760 --> 36:28.719
give it back,

820
36:29.400 --> 36:30.400
but he fell into a coma.

821
36:31.719 --> 36:32.440
Then

822
36:32.519 --> 36:33.440
things happened.

823
36:34.920 --> 36:36.079
And it got delayed.

824
36:39.440 --> 36:40.239
Keep the money.

825
36:40.400 --> 36:41.599
I never touched a penny,

826
36:42.199 --> 36:43.519
waiting to return it.

827
36:45.079 --> 36:46.000
Ms. Hui,

828
36:46.519 --> 36:47.559
you saved my dad's life.

829
36:48.039 --> 36:49.400
This was his way of thanking you.

830
36:50.239 --> 36:51.159
Didn't you say

831
36:51.159 --> 36:51.840
that your dream

832
36:52.199 --> 36:53.440
was to run

833
36:53.519 --> 36:54.239
a small business

834
36:54.679 --> 36:55.719
and live a peaceful life?

835
36:56.519 --> 36:58.639
Consider this the seed money

836
36:59.360 --> 37:00.440
for your dream.

837
37:02.119 --> 37:02.559
Ms. Hui,

838
37:03.280 --> 37:04.719
we both need to start fresh

839
37:05.239 --> 37:05.920
and live well.

840
37:09.000 --> 37:09.920
It's not that easy.

841
37:11.320 --> 37:11.719
Right,

842
37:12.400 --> 37:13.679
any word on Peng Cheng?

843
37:14.039 --> 37:14.719
After that day,

844
37:14.800 --> 37:15.840
he completely vanished.

845
37:16.079 --> 37:17.000
I just couldn't

846
37:17.159 --> 37:17.840
reach him.

847
37:18.984 --> 37:20.744
(Peng Cheng)

848
37:23.519 --> 37:24.119
Where are you?

849
37:24.880 --> 37:26.039
Why didn't you show up?

850
37:26.519 --> 37:28.519
Di Liren suspects me now.

851
37:29.079 --> 37:29.920
He ambushed me

852
37:30.000 --> 37:31.000
on my way.

853
37:31.559 --> 37:33.000
He beat me up

854
37:33.119 --> 37:33.880
and searched me

855
37:33.920 --> 37:34.960
from head to toe.

856
37:35.360 --> 37:36.440
Luckily, I planned ahead

857
37:36.559 --> 37:37.599
and didn't carry the IOU.

858
37:37.960 --> 37:38.760
If he found nothing,

859
37:39.679 --> 37:40.679
why did he let you go?

860
37:41.159 --> 37:42.159
I ran.

861
37:42.480 --> 37:43.760
(Peng Cheng) With my quick moves...

862
37:44.480 --> 37:45.159
Never mind.

863
37:45.360 --> 37:45.997
Not important.

864
37:47.519 --> 37:49.119
The point is,

865
37:49.119 --> 37:50.559
this guy is ruthless.

866
37:51.800 --> 37:53.119
Every day I keep this IOU,

867
37:53.199 --> 37:54.280
my life is in danger.

868
37:54.960 --> 37:55.920
I'm done with him.

869
37:57.199 --> 37:58.039
What's your plan?

870
37:58.400 --> 37:59.199
Let's make a deal.

871
37:59.599 --> 38:00.880
I get the cash,

872
38:01.400 --> 38:02.440
take off,

873
38:02.880 --> 38:03.760
and we're done.

874
38:04.360 --> 38:04.920
Do we

875
38:04.960 --> 38:05.639
have a deal?

876
38:07.190 --> 38:08.119
How are we doing this?

877
38:08.719 --> 38:09.760
I'll give you the IOU.

878
38:10.400 --> 38:11.159
We meet alone.

879
38:11.559 --> 38:12.079
Come alone.

880
38:12.239 --> 38:13.560
I'll text you the time and place.

881
38:14.360 --> 38:15.119
At this point,

882
38:15.280 --> 38:16.599
you're the only one I can trust.

883
38:20.960 --> 38:21.480
Deal.

884
38:21.880 --> 38:23.320
Then it's settled.

885
38:23.519 --> 38:24.039
Remember,

886
38:24.519 --> 38:25.360
come alone,

887
38:25.800 --> 38:26.748
or the deal is off.

888
38:32.159 --> 38:32.679
Look,

889
38:32.960 --> 38:33.559
I've done

890
38:33.679 --> 38:35.239
everything you asked, right?

891
38:36.199 --> 38:37.239
I handed over the IOU.

892
38:38.000 --> 38:39.119
What about my cut?

893
38:41.719 --> 38:42.280
Fine.

894
38:42.320 --> 38:43.000
You're the boss.

895
38:43.000 --> 38:43.960
That's it.

896
38:55.480 --> 38:57.400
If you breathe a word of this,

897
38:58.360 --> 38:59.000
your loan sharks

898
38:59.039 --> 39:00.119
will find you.

899
39:01.960 --> 39:03.000
No matter where you hide,

900
39:03.480 --> 39:04.679
they will skin you alive.

901
39:04.880 --> 39:05.400
Don't worry.

902
39:06.159 --> 39:07.559
My lips are sealed.

903
39:20.679 --> 39:21.039
Alright.

904
39:22.880 --> 39:23.239
Here.

905
39:27.272 --> 39:27.719
(Lu Hui)

906
39:27.719 --> 39:28.480
(Tonight at 10 PM.)

907
39:28.960 --> 39:29.920
(Jinshui Bridge.)

908
39:44.559 --> 39:45.119
Di Liren.

909
39:56.239 --> 39:57.519
You put Peng Cheng

910
39:58.360 --> 39:59.320
to make that call.

911
40:01.039 --> 40:01.880
What a surprise.

912
40:03.159 --> 40:04.960
You showed up instead of Lu Hui.

913
40:05.440 --> 40:06.320
Are you two

914
40:06.480 --> 40:07.119
that close now?

915
40:07.119 --> 40:08.039
None of your business.

916
40:09.719 --> 40:10.239
Speak up.

917
40:11.440 --> 40:12.106
Where's the IOU?

918
40:12.239 --> 40:13.079
I made it clear.

919
40:13.840 --> 40:14.960
She had to come alone,

920
40:15.800 --> 40:16.719
or the deal is off.

921
40:17.679 --> 40:18.119
Stop.

922
40:19.840 --> 40:20.960
You killed

923
40:22.000 --> 40:23.079
Lu Hui's father,

924
40:23.880 --> 40:24.239
right?

925
40:28.559 --> 40:29.159
Yu Meng,

926
40:29.639 --> 40:31.280
you're still as reckless as ever.

927
40:32.519 --> 40:33.320
Where's your proof?

928
40:34.719 --> 40:35.280
Proof?

929
40:38.039 --> 40:39.280
Peng Cheng is the proof.

930
40:39.880 --> 40:41.360
Why would a money-obsessed man

931
40:41.639 --> 40:42.320
like you

932
40:42.360 --> 40:43.519
keep caving to his blackmail?

933
40:43.880 --> 40:44.280
See?

934
40:45.320 --> 40:46.119
Didn't I say

935
40:46.480 --> 40:47.246
you were reckless?

936
40:48.079 --> 40:49.400
Was that caving to blackmail?

937
40:51.000 --> 40:52.599
I was simply helping out

938
40:52.679 --> 40:53.559
a fellow townsman.

939
40:54.039 --> 40:54.559
Also,

940
40:55.159 --> 40:56.566
you think I'm obsessed with money.

941
40:57.159 --> 40:58.280
But I busted my back

942
40:58.280 --> 40:59.013
for your family.

943
40:59.199 --> 41:00.199
After all these years,

944
41:01.239 --> 41:02.400
can't you see it?

945
41:02.840 --> 41:03.920
My hard work

946
41:04.079 --> 41:05.073
made the company thrive.

947
41:05.880 --> 41:06.920
- Your dad... - Shut up.

948
41:07.719 --> 41:08.199
Di Liren,

949
41:08.440 --> 41:09.572
how dare you bring him up?

950
41:10.119 --> 41:10.719
Listen.

951
41:10.951 --> 41:12.362
You're nothing without the platform

952
41:12.440 --> 41:13.119
he gave you.

953
41:13.440 --> 41:14.679
I brought you the connections

954
41:14.880 --> 41:15.493
and resources,

955
41:15.599 --> 41:16.599
or you'd be nothing.

956
41:17.440 --> 41:19.000
A killer is a killer.

957
41:19.360 --> 41:21.159
No matter how well you dress,

958
41:21.519 --> 41:22.320
you're nothing

959
41:22.519 --> 41:23.679
but a piece of trash.

960
41:26.280 --> 41:27.639
You try to destroy the evidence

961
41:28.159 --> 41:29.679
because you feel guilty.

962
41:29.960 --> 41:30.760
Silencing Peng Cheng

963
41:30.800 --> 41:31.440
won't get you

964
41:31.679 --> 41:32.400
off the hook.

965
41:33.239 --> 41:33.960
I'm telling you.

966
41:35.159 --> 41:36.280
I will find the proof.

967
41:41.480 --> 41:44.328
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

968
41:44.599 --> 41:45.639
We'll go to Xiaocheng.

969
41:46.000 --> 41:47.880
He has to pay for what he did.

970
41:48.480 --> 41:49.719
He will pay for this.

971
41:50.239 --> 41:51.639
Oh, no! Fang Haoyu is missing.

972
41:52.039 --> 41:52.719
Seen Harry?

973
41:52.880 --> 41:53.936
Where else could he go?

974
41:54.199 --> 41:55.079
If it weren't for me,

975
41:55.320 --> 41:56.159
we wouldn't just be

976
41:56.159 --> 41:57.519
visiting your dad's grave,

977
41:57.920 --> 41:59.000
but also our son's.

978
42:01.559 --> 42:01.960
Mom.

979
42:03.119 --> 42:03.519
Mom.

980
42:04.320 --> 42:04.800
Mom.

981
42:04.968 --> 42:05.599
(Police)

982
42:05.599 --> 42:06.320
Let me go.

983
42:06.559 --> 42:07.679
Mom.

984
42:23.144 --> 42:28.013
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

985
42:30.497 --> 42:35.360
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

986
42:37.818 --> 42:42.663
♪The love that stumbled along♪

987
42:43.108 --> 42:49.610
♪Was just a quiet release♪

988
42:52.342 --> 42:59.295
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

989
42:59.845 --> 43:05.775
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

990
43:06.899 --> 43:14.130
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

991
43:14.433 --> 43:19.606
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

992
43:20.226 --> 43:31.694
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

993
43:34.194 --> 43:39.442
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

994
43:41.483 --> 43:46.918
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

995
43:48.740 --> 43:54.137
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

996
43:54.137 --> 44:02.782
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

997
44:03.258 --> 44:10.821
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

998
44:10.821 --> 44:16.667
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

999
44:16.667 --> 44:26.834
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
